      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each thread fetches one value of A1 and one of B1 from global. Barrier.\nThen all 4 threads compute from shared memory and keep a running total.",
